ttest/adapters/claude-code/run\\\",\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"question_class\\\",\\\"ruling_id\\\":null}],\\\"proposal\\\":{\\\"ruling_text\\\":\\\"The stop is non-question: the executor ended the build through the question channel with a null question. A background test still running is progress state, not a question about the definition of done. The adapter’s question guard governs this specimen; the stage should be recorded as non-question with executor provenance.\\\",\\\"patch\\\":null,\\\"question\\\":null}}\"}}\n517:+{\"class\": \"non-question\", \"verdict\": \"answer\", \"citations\": [{\"kind\": \"instruction\", \"path\": \"/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/README.md\", \"symbol\": \"build status/question contract\", \"ruling_id\": null}, {\"kind\": \"mechanism\", \"path\": \"/Users/davidbean/Projects/attavo-worktree-151/attest/records/151/build-01.log\", \"symbol\": \"StructuredOutput(status=\\\"question\\\", question=null)\", \"ruling_id\": null}, {\"kind\": \"guard\", \"path\": \"/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/claude-code/run\", \"symbol\": \"question_class\", \"ruling_id\": null}], \"proposal\": {\"ruling_text\": \"The stop is non-question: the executor ended the build through the question channel with a null question. A background test still running is progress state, not a question about the definition of done. The adapter\\u2019s question guard governs this specimen; the stage should be recorded as non-question with executor provenance.\", \"patch\": null, \"question\": null}}\n519:diff --git a/attest/records/151/spec-01.json b/attest/records/151/spec-01.json\n524:@@ -0,0 +1,29 @@\n538:+      \"name\": \"recover-writes-a-died-record.sh\",\n554:diff --git a/attest/specs/151/criteria/died-and-hung-are-stop-classes.sh b/attest/specs/151/criteria/died-and-hung-are-stop-classes.sh\n559:@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@\n568:+assert \"stall_after_s\" in drive[\"properties\"], drive\n571:diff --git a/attest/specs/151/criteria/doctor-fails-on-an-invocation-without