 this host and no build-01.json, attavo doctor --json fails proof no-invocation-lacks-record naming build-01, and holds once build-01.json exists\n687:+- recover-writes-a-died-record.sh: on the same fixture, attavo drive --recover 1 writes build-01.json with status failed and stop class died, provenance product, with a log beside it, committed by the driver identity with a clean tree, after which proof five holds\n688:+- died-and-hung-are-stop-classes.sh: both stage schemas' stop enums name died and hung, the manifest schema declares [drive].stall_after_s, and bin/attavo's STOP_CLASSES names both\n689:diff --git a/attest/specs/151/stub/attavo.toml b/attest/specs/151/stub/attavo.toml\n694:@@ -0,0 +1,51 @@\n705:+build = \"claude-code\"\n708:+[executor.claude-code]\n745:+stall_after_s = 1800\n746:diff --git a/attest/specs/151/stub/bin/attavo b/attest/specs/151/stub/bin/attavo\n751:@@ -0,0 +1,3662 @@\n985:+alone raised (GUARDED_STOP_CLASSES), else \"none\". A record too old to\n1289:+STOP_CLASSES = (\"non-question\", \"outlived-invocation\", \"no-cause\", \"forge-unconcluded\",\n1295:+# (adapters/claude-code/run and adapters/codex/run, on main since\n1313:+    # adapters/claude-code/run's own pre-emptive refusal -- which must\n1364:+    \"\"\"Whichever of STOP_CLASSES this text names -- its own spelling, or\n1374:+    for name in STOP_CLASSES:\n1388:+        line (issue #88, #94), when it names a STOP_CLASSES member -- is\n1440:+    if report_class in STOP_CLASSES:\n1558:+INVOCATION_MARKER_SUFFIX = \".started\"\n1567:+    host, pid, the sha it starts on, and the product that started it.\n1604:+    \"\"\"Every <stage>-NN.started under one item whose <stage>-NN.json has\n1621:+    \"\"\"[drive].stall_after_s: the tenant's own bound past which a live\n1624:+    bound = (m.get(\"drive\") or {}).get(\"stall_after_s\")\n1639:+        return p.fail(\"no [drive].stall_after_s in the manifest; a hung invocation cannot be \"\n1653:+            problems.append(f\"{name} started {i